Exclusion Criteria:

* Patients who have previously received anti-PD-1, anti-PD-L1, anti-PD-L2 therapy, or VEGFR Tyrosine Kinase Inhibitors(TKI) therapy.
* Patients currently receiving anti-tumor treatment.
